WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.850
Speaker 1: For years now.

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:08.740
One of the false claims that the right has
been throwing at the left in the United States

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.690
is that the left wants to defund the police.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:15.530
Now, we've covered this so extensively.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.960
Certainly you can go on Twitter or Reddit
and find some people who say defund the police

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.860
or all cops are bastards or whatever slogan
they come up with.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.410
But overwhelmingly, no one wants to defund
the police.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:35.160
Even those in the Democratic Party, the vast
majority, say we need to reform the police.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:41.800
I've put out a pretty extensive 8 to 10 point
plan on how to improve policing, and this

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.660
includes training and retraining of different
kinds.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.340
This includes demilitarization.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:52.430
This includes, yes, having a an unarmed force
that can respond to certain types of calls,

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:59.710
but in some cases, it actually might involve
funding the police more in order to get police

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:05.000
away from the low hanging fruit policing that
actually causes the problems anyway.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:12.460
The point is, you know as well as I do, I'm
sure that defund the police exists almost

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:17.690
nowhere and has no influence on the mainstream
Democratic Party.

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:23.230
And suddenly Republican Congressman Jim Jordan
says he's going to defund the police because

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:24.230
Trump was indicted.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.500
Now he's talking, of course, of federal police.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.610
And it's become very popular for Republicans
to go after federal police.

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.080
Let's take a look at this clip.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:36.409
This is from the Maria BARTIROMO program over
the weekend.

00:01:36.409 --> 00:01:37.409
Take a listen.

00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:38.409
It is nation.

00:01:38.409 --> 00:01:39.409
Speaker 2: Right laws and pass legislation.

00:01:39.409 --> 00:01:40.530
So we'll look at that.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:45.049
And maybe most importantly, Maria, is we control
the power of the purse and that's what we're

00:01:45.049 --> 00:01:46.049
going to.

00:01:46.049 --> 00:01:47.049
Speaker 1: Have to look at the appropriations
process and.

00:01:47.049 --> 00:01:50.729
Speaker 2: Limit funds going to some of these
agencies, particularly the ones who are engaged

00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:52.110
in the most egregious behavior.

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:57.170
So the DOJ and the FBI.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.170
Yeah.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.170
And what I'd really like, frankly.

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:03.060
Speaker 1: Yeah, the DOJ and the FBI.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:07.430
They want to defund federal police.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:12.319
They say we are for law and order and against
defunding the police.

00:02:12.319 --> 00:02:17.629
But all of a sudden, Donald Trump has to comply
with the law and the legal orders as they

00:02:17.629 --> 00:02:22.700
love to obsess with of law enforcement and
prosecutors and so on and so forth.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:28.121
And all of a sudden they say, get rid of the
entire department, defund the FBI, defund

00:02:28.121 --> 00:02:30.030
the DOJ.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:36.780
These are the very same people who while saying,
we support the police and you're bad for wanting

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:43.400
to defund the police were on the side of the
rioters rather than the police when it came

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:47.659
to the January 6th riotous insurrection.

00:02:47.659 --> 00:02:52.659
And in this particular case with Trump and
we still listen, it's going to be a while

00:02:52.659 --> 00:02:57.310
